# A bare `return` on its own line ends the execution of the body with no value (#call-receivers): inside 1, and the
# line after it does not run. Red until the slice that executes the held form and the example iterate (Р151); the
# kernel today goes on past the line and gives 2.
(
    Observed:
        int: inside 0
)
sub: main ()
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Observed\inside := 1
    return
    shared\Observed\inside := 2
main()
